1
00:00:00,508 --> 00:00:02,008
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear Lord.

2
00:00:02,176 --> 00:00:04,676
(Penny:)- We have to go.
- Not now, this poor man needs me.

3
00:00:04,845 --> 00:00:06,885
(Sheldon:)You, hold on, I'll be right with you.

4
00:00:07,056 --> 00:00:11,226
(Sheldon:)What computer do you have,
and please don't say a white one.

5
00:00:16,649 --> 00:00:18,899
- Excuse me.
- Fill this out and have a seat.

6
00:00:19,068 --> 00:00:21,358
(Howard:)We're throwing
my friend a surprise party...

7
00:00:21,529 --> 00:00:23,859
(Howard:)...and I'm supposed to keep him out
for two hours.

8
00:00:24,031 --> 00:00:26,161
(Nurse:)Uh-huh. Fill this out and have a seat.

9
00:00:26,325 --> 00:00:29,115
The way I could get him
to leave was tell him I ate a peanut.

10
00:00:29,286 --> 00:00:30,996
(Howard:)I'm allergic to peanuts.

11
00:00:31,163 --> 00:00:34,413
(Nurse:)Well, in that case,
fill this out and have a seat.

12
00:00:35,292 --> 00:00:37,712
(Howard:)All I need from you
is to give me a BAND-AID.

13
00:00:37,878 --> 00:00:39,378
I can pretend I had epinephrine.

14
00:00:39,547 --> 00:00:42,547
(Howard:)Tell my friend you need to keep me
under observation for an hour.

15
00:00:42,716 --> 00:00:44,006
- Is that all you need?
- Yes.

16
00:00:44,176 --> 00:00:45,756
(Nurse:)Get out of my ER.

17
00:00:46,595 --> 00:00:48,425
- No, you don't understand.
- I understand.

18
00:00:48,597 --> 00:00:52,347
(Nurse:)But unfortunately, this hospital
is not equipped to treat stupid.

19
00:00:53,894 --> 00:00:56,274
(Howard:)Okay, I get it.
I know how the world works.

20
00:00:56,438 --> 00:01:06,028
(Howard:)How about if I were to introduce you
to the man who freed your people?

